{"meta":{"ph":"trʌŋk; NAmE trʌŋk","pos":"noun","stars":"★★"},"defs":[{"def":"the thick main stem of a tree, that the branches grow from 树干","ex":[{"s":"Then, with one end of a rope tied to his waist and the other end around the trunk of a tree, Ziyad began ____47____ .","src":"2023浙江1月卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"然后,用一根绳子的一端绑在腰部,另一端环绕一棵树的树干,齐亚德____47____开始了."},{"s":"The force required to break the pancake was less than 1% of the trunk’s weight (about 100kg).","src":"2022天津4月卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"掰开那块“煎饼”所需的力小于树干重量（约100公斤）的1%。"},{"s":"I was running so fast that I bounced off the trunk and  40   on my backside.","src":"2020浙江1月卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"我跑得太快，从树干上弹开，一屁股 40  坐在地上。"},{"s":"Before the heavy lifting began, the team assessed the root system and dug a five-foot-deep cylinder , measuring 40 feet in diameter, around the trunk to protect all essential roots.","src":"2018上海卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"在重物起吊开始前，团队评估了根系，并在树干周围挖了一个深五英尺、直径40英尺的圆柱形坑，以保护所有关键根系。"},{"s":"The elephant was found to either use suction at a fixed distance from the pancake to \"raise” the object in the air and hold it, or gently press the tip of its trunk against the pancake and apply suction to pick it up.","src":"2022天津4月卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"研究发现，大象要么在离煎饼固定距离处使用吸力把物体抬到空中并吸住，要么轻轻把象鼻尖压在煎饼上施加吸力把它捡起。"},{"s":"What can be learned about an elephant’s trunk in the experiment?","src":"2022天津4月卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"从实验中可以了解到大象的鼻子什么？"},{"s":"The little plum tree outside, with the faintly flushed snow lining its branches and artfully disposed along its trunk, stood in full sunlight.","src":"外研社B6 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"外面的小梅子树, 微小的冲积的雪在树枝上, 沿着树干巧妙地处理, 站在满天的阳光下。"},{"s":"Now the trunks of trees on the bottom, and the old log canoe, and the dark surrounding woods, are gone, and the villagers, who scarcely know where it lies, instead of going to the pond to bathe or drink, are thinking to bring its water...","src":"外研社B6 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"现在树底的树干,旧木舟,以及周围阴暗的树林,都不见了,村民们几乎不知道它在哪里,而不是去池塘洗澡或喝酒,而是在想带水......"},{"s":"The Waka is a traditional canoe that has been skillfully carved out of a tree trunk, with beautiful carvings added to show tribal history and culture.","src":"人教B3 U5","cat":"renjiao","t":"瓦卡号是一款传统的独木舟,由树干巧妙地雕刻而成,加上了美丽的雕刻,以展示部落历史和文化."},{"s":"The elephant’s nose, or trunk, is also used to make noises and to welcome other elephants.","src":"人教选必1 U5","cat":"renjiao","t":"大象的鼻子或树干也被用来制造噪音和欢迎其他大象."},{"s":"If an elephant spreads its ears, it means “Watch out!” To show friendship, elephants will touch each other with their trunks and stand close to each other, putting their heads together.","src":"人教选必1 U5","cat":"renjiao","t":"如果一头大象散开耳朵,意思是“小心!”为了显示友谊,大象会用树干互相摸摸,并站在一起,把头放在一起。"}]},{"def":"the space at the back of a car that you put bags, cases, etc. in （汽车后部的）行李箱","ex":[]},{"def":"the long nose of an elephant 象鼻","ex":[{"s":"He stopped every few minutes to move the ____48____ higher up the tree trunk.","src":"2023浙江1月卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"他每隔几分钟就停下____48____来 把树干往上移"}]},{"def":"a large strong box with a lid used for storing or transporting clothes, books, etc. 大箱子；大衣箱","ex":[]},{"def":"the main part of the human body apart from the head, arms and legs （人的）躯干","ex":[]}]}